s</a></li>\r\n<li><a class=\"d_block color_dark relative\" href=\"/index.php/contact-us/access-to-information\">Access to Information</a></li>\r\n<li><a class=\"d_block color_dark relative\" href=\"http://mail.live.com\">Staff Mail</a></li>\r\n<li><a class=\"d_block color_dark relative\" href=\"/index.php/contact-us\">Our Contacts</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/banner1xx.jpg\" width=\"100%\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section_offset\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container clearfix\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-9 m_xs_bottom_30\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-page\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<meta itemprop=\"inLanguage\" content=\"en-GB\" />\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header\">\n\t\t<h2 itemprop=\"headline\">\n\t\t\tPresidential Launch of Maralal Water Supply Project, Samburu County on 10th November 2025\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n\t\t<p>His Excellency President William Samoei Ruto officially launched Phase I of the Maralal Water Supply Project in Maralal, Samburu County.</p>\r\n \r\n<p>The project, which sources its water from the recently completed Yamo Dam, aims to significantly enhance the reliability of water supply in Maralal Town by strengthening the existing system and addressing the long-standing challenge of inadequate water provision.<br />Upon completion, the project will mark a major milestone in improving access to clean, safe, and reliable water for the residents of Maralal Town and its environs.<br />The President was accompanied by the Governor of Samburu County, the Cabinet Secretary for Water, Sanitation and Irrigation, Eng. Mugaa Murithi Eric, and other senior government officials.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:,\" /></p>\t</div>\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s2s_supra_contenedor lang_directon_right s2sdefault  align_left  s2s_balloon_bottom \" ><input name=\"social2s_url\" type=\"hidden\" class=\"social2s_url\" value=\"https://nwwda.go.ke/index.php/news-events/108-residential-launch-of-maralal-water-supply-project-samburu-county-on-10th-november-2025\" /><div class=\"s2s_contenedor  s2s_no_text  s2s-btn-group\"><div class=\"s2s_twitter s2s_twitter_own s2s_btn s2s-btn-default \">\n\t\t\t<a class=\"s2s_icon\"><i class=\"s2sfo fo-twitter\"></i>   </a>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"globo s2s_globo_closed s2s_twitter_iframe\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s2s_flecha\"></div><div class=\"s2s_div_btn_twitter\"><a class=\"s2s_a_btn s2s_btn_twitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Presidential%20Launch%20of%20Maralal%20Water%20Supply%20Project%2C%20Samburu%20County%20on%2010th%20November%202025&url=https://nwwda.go.ke/index.php/news-events/108-residential-launch-of-maralal-water-supply-project-samburu-county-on-10th-november-2025\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"s2sfo fo-twitter\"></i> <span>Tweet</span></a></div></div>\n\t\t</div><div class=\"s2s_facebook s2s_btn s2s-btn-default \" >\n\t\t\t<a class=\"s2s_icon\"><i class=\"s2sfo fo-facebook\"></i>   </a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"globo s2s_globo_closed s2s_facebook_iframe\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s2s_flecha\"></div><div class=\"fb-share-button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-layout=\"button_count\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-href=\"https://nwwda.go.ke/index.php/news-events/108-residential-launch-of-maralal-water-supply-project-samburu-county-on-10th-november-2025\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-size=\"small\" \n\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a target=\"_